<section class="resource-hero">
  <div class="site-shell resource-hero-inner">
    <div class="resource-hero-copy reveal">
      <p class="section-kicker">互动资源</p>
      <h1>桌搭子资源包</h1>
      <p class="resource-hero-lead">下载互动词包与小剧场剧本，解压后可在 Windows 和 macOS 客户端中多选导入。</p>
      <dl class="resource-hero-stats" aria-label="校园热梗资源包内容">
        <div><dt>5 套</dt><dd>互动词包</dd></div>
        <div><dt>3,600 句</dt><dd>互动台词</dd></div>
        <div><dt>5 个</dt><dd>完整小剧场</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="resource-hero-media reveal" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="<%= url_for('/images/pet-keyboard.gif') %>?v=<%= theme.asset_version %>" width="560" height="560" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
      <img src="<%= url_for('/images/pet-celebrate.gif') %>?v=<%= theme.asset_version %>" width="560" height="560" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="resource-preview" aria-labelledby="resource-preview-title">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="resource-preview-heading reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">内容预览</p>
        <h2 id="resource-preview-title">先看看，它们会说些什么。</h2>
      </div>
      <p>校园日常、轻松吐槽和一点点嘴硬，都已经整理成可以直接导入的 JSON 文件。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="resource-preview-grid">
      <article class="resource-preview-block reveal">
        <p class="resource-preview-type">互动词包 / 校园嘴替局</p>
        <h3>不同状态，都有一句接得住的话。</h3>
        <ul class="word-preview-list">
          <li><span>待机</span><q>早八还没点名，我先替你的灵魂占个座。</q></li>
          <li><span>拖动</span><q>轻点拎，我不是落在教室的帆布包。</q></li>
          <li><span>开心</span><q>恭喜你把普通一天玩成了高光局。</q></li>
          <li><span>鼓励</span><q>先做一小步，卷王也不是一天练成的。</q></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="resource-preview-meta">每套 24 个触发场景 · 每个场景 30 句 · 共 720 句</p>
      </article>
      <article class="resource-preview-block reveal">
        <p class="resource-preview-type">小剧场 / 早八搭子心动事故</p>
        <h3>两只桌宠，把日常演成五轮对白。</h3>
        <ol class="theater-preview-list">
          <li>
            <p><span>主角</span>快醒醒，早八老师点名了，你的灵魂还卡在加载页。</p>
            <p><span>搭子</span>别慌，我替你答到，你替我解释为什么我们坐这么近。</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p><span>主角</span>这是战术占座，不是暧昧，懂的都懂。</p>
            <p><span>搭子</span>确实，战术到你的奶茶吸管都放我这边了。</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p><span>主角</span>下课铃响了，今天这局算我主动一点。</p>
            <p><span>搭子</span>成交，先去食堂，恋爱脑也得按时吃饭。</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="resource-preview-meta">完整文件包含 5 轮、10 句对白，可与其他剧本一起多选导入</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="resource-catalog" aria-labelledby="resource-catalog-title">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <div class="resource-catalog-heading reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">资源目录</p>
        <h2 id="resource-catalog-title">挑一套喜欢的内容。</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="resource-filters" role="tablist" aria-label="资源分类">
        <button class="is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-resource-filter="all">全部</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-resource-filter="interaction-words">互动词包</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-resource-filter="theater-scripts">小剧场剧本</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="resource-list" data-resource-list aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="resource-state" data-resource-state>
      <span class="resource-state-mark" aria-hidden="true">...</span>
      <p>正在读取资源包</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="resource-import-note">
  <div class="site-shell resource-import-note-inner reveal">
    <img src="<%= url_for('/images/app-icon.png') %>" width="58" height="58" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <div>
      <strong>下载 ZIP，解压后多选导入</strong>
      <p>互动词包支持 JSON / TXT，小剧场剧本使用 JSON。客户端会在导入前检查格式和数量上限。</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button button-secondary" href="<%= url_for('/download/') %>">下载客户端</a>
  </div>
</section>
